And he says, if it should later turn out that these means are not as good as those we shall have in 100 years' time, this is no reason for mortification today, since we know quite well that the better which is to come would never have hatched out had we not begotten the best that is possible now, however imperfect it may be.

00:07:16.217 --> 00:07:37.125
Meaning Jung is not really completely attached to the concepts and ideas that he has. For example, he says, oh, the psyche is an energetic system, and the energy he called libido. He does not say like, okay, libido is something that is touchable and directly measurable and all these different things.

00:07:37.254 --> 00:07:54.839
It's more like a shorthand to explain certain phenomena, how they relate to each other. Why we forget things, how certain fantasies suddenly come up, how we have a lot of willpower to do something or not, or how we lose our capacity to do things when we are depressed, for example.

00:07:56.154 --> 00:08:11.749
