00:08:12.665 --> 00:08:36.115
He says he goes there to understand as much as possible and talk about what he saw, but he said it will likely be for, for other people who will come after him to really colonize this continent, to really map it out, to categorize everything, to take pictures and all these and explain it better. So he says he worked in the means and the capacities that he had at his time.

00:08:37.080 --> 00:08:55.029
And very likely the things that he's talking about will be superseded with other ideas in the future. And this is true for many fields. So based on, for example, what we're able to measure in physics, the field of physics also changed.

