Because he says, the scientific intellect is inhuman and cannot afford to be anything else. It cannot avoid being ruthless in effect, though it may be well-intentioned in motive. Mm-hmm. Meaning for those who work in science know it's, that it's very hard and very difficult.

00:10:00.965 --> 00:10:23.154
