00:10:23.267 --> 00:10:46.023
They have to falsify everything. And then they let other people who went through the same process check on that work to really make sure that you're honing in on really some truth. And this of course removes a lot of things, a lot of the world. Not the world is not completely scientific, meaning not everything is completely mappable that way.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:11:05.137
And it's a very, very hard and long process to get there. But when you get there, you get there some fundamental truth that you can understand and use. Like for example, what we have in the modern world today that we can fly, we have the internet, we living longer, we are healthier, and all these different things. This is due to science.

00:11:05.411 --> 00:11:18.361
