00:16:59.992 --> 00:17:17.435
And there's many different ways how to do it, and there's many different ways how this is talked about. I have to make a disclaimer. I'm not a scientist. I'm an engineer. I'm happy when stuff works. And I'm even worse, like I work in sales, so I'm happy when something works already good enough that somebody is willing to buy it.

00:17:19.340 --> 00:17:37.216
