It's a lot of people looking at a lot of data and cutting away everything that's not related to that. So the things that we will talk about today and that I brought and that I researched will be that it will be strongly stated and clearly stated ideas and whether they will be able to replicate it in kind of meta-analysis.

00:20:33.385 --> 00:20:55.695
