And what about dreams? And this really surprised me. There's a lot of research into dreams and a lot of things that Jung talked about were proven to be right. So what Jung talked about and what Freud also talked about They said, okay, the dream is kind of continuation of the waking life. So what Jung says is we have our consciousness.

00:29:42.906 --> 00:30:01.187
This is how we experience things and how we interact with the day. But we have our unconscious also in the back of our mind, and it also experiences a lot of things, and it will bring these things to us when we have a lower state of consciousness, meaning we are going to sleep, we're dreaming, we're closing our eyes, we are turning inward.

00:30:01.676 --> 00:30:24.822
